WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.125
Lower the film and the winder in together, on the left,

2
00:00:04.125 --> 00:00:07.175
with the film's lip pointing to the middle of the camera.

3
00:00:07.175 --> 00:00:09.468
Keep them together as they go in.

4
00:00:09.468 --> 00:00:14.883
The film sits flat in its chamber, and the green winder sits in its slot on top,

5
00:00:14.883 --> 00:00:16.758
just as it did before.

6
00:00:16.758 --> 00:00:19.023
If the film will not sit flat,

7
00:00:19.023 --> 00:00:22.174
lift it out and try again with the lip facing the middle.

